# code: language=helm

{{/*
============================================================
Atlas Values Loader (stage 3)
============================================================

Helmfile evaluates this file once per release at release-time, with
.Release.* and .Values.atlas.* both available. The output IS the merged
values blob for the release.

The actual merge logic lives in the atlas.values.merged named template
(templates/_values_loader.tpl) so that stage-3's redaction-map builder
can call the same logic with redact=true. This file is a thin wrapper
that invokes the shared logic with redact=false (real values for helm).
*/}}

{{- include "atlas.values.merged" (dict
    "Values" .Values
    "Release" .Release
    "redact" false
) }}
